 #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]caret_address_goto_capture.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/caret_address_goto_capture.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-q7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-q7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: claim, resolve, and refuse the bare caret address[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-goto[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-goto: add the shared whole-draft caret-address claim, the read-only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolver (exact hit, duplicates, archive hop, did-you-mean), the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-parse task_goto mode and goto payload, the bob capture refusal, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar +1, docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: Go rows for @route^ completion, mint-collision copy, [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and /route^id search[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-browse[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-goto[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-browse: add the additive block_id.goto rows to task_block_id [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion for bare @route^ and partial IDs, teach the new form in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mint-collision error, index route^id in the / search fields, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document all three.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins: any-line block fallback in the Go To re-find [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]ladder[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-refind[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-refind: let bob-goto-task re-find a unique non-task line carrying[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]^block when the task-only lookup misses, with tests, docs, build, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac: Go To destination card and Return dispatch[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-goto[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-card: decode the parse goto payload, render the found, miss, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicate cards in place of the write preview, relabel the primary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]button, and dispatch the Go To on Return through the / landing path with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]an accept-time fresh parse.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac: Go rows in the block-ID card[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-browse[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-browse, mac-card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-browse: turn the goto-eligible block-ID card into a scoped Go To [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]browse (selectable Go rows, exact preselect, archived section, Return [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lands, Tab completes), update mint copy, and mirror the /route^id search[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]key.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end verification and docs closeout[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]closeout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plugin-refind, mac-browse[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closeout: verify every acceptance case against the real vault read-only,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm plugin deploy and green macOS CI on the landed SHAs, reconcile [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cross-repo docs, and write the decision record only if approved.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_b